{
    "title": "Rentler",
    "description": "Rentler gives you the keys to make it simple to go from searching to moving in. \r\n\r\nWith Rentler, you can create custom searches, fill out one application and submit it to multiple places, and talk directly with landlords & schedule tours online.\r\n\r\nJoin the millions of renters who have found a place to call home using Rentler.\r\n\r\nSmart Filters\r\nLove it? Give it a heart to save it to your favorites. Not into it? Thumbs down and get more tailored search results in your area.\r\n\r\nFavorited Listings\r\nKeep track of your favorite rentals all in one place and view all the relevant details like square footage, amenities, move-in specials, and more.\r\n\r\nSecure Applications\r\nInstantly submit applications so you can start moving in faster. Rentler Applications include a credit & background check so you can stop wasting time (and money) waiting for approval.\r\n\r\nFaster communication\r\nHave a question about a property? Want to schedule a tour and see more? You can do it all right from the listing. \r\n\r\nContact Us\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/rentler\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/rentler\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/rentler\r\n\r\nUsage of the Rentler app is bound by our terms of service - https://www.rentler.com/page/terms-of-use\r\n\r\nWe want your feedback! Questions or comments? Email hello@rentler.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Rentler gives you the keys to make it simple to go from searching to moving in. <br><br>With Rentler, you can create custom searches, fill out one application and submit it to multiple places, and talk directly with landlords &amp; schedule tours online.<br><br>Join the millions of renters who have found a place to call home using Rentler.<br><br>Smart Filters<br>Love it? Give it a heart to save it to your favorites. Not into it? Thumbs down and get more tailored search results in your area.<br><br>Favorited Listings<br>Keep track of your favorite rentals all in one place and view all the relevant details like square footage, amenities, move-in specials, and more.<br><br>Secure Applications<br>Instantly submit applications so you can start moving in faster. Rentler Applications include a credit &amp; background check so you can stop wasting time (and money) waiting for approval.<br><br>Faster communication<br>Have a question about a property? Want to schedule a tour and see more? You can do it all right from the listing. <br><br>Contact Us<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/rentler<br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/rentler<br>Twitter: https://twitter.com/rentler<br><br>Usage of the Rentler app is bound by our terms of service - https://www.rentler.com/page/terms-of-use<br><br>We want your feedback! Questions or comments? Email hello@rentler.com",
